# Sprite-render pipeline output is committed reference art so the
# agent can inspect animations between sessions without re-running
# the renderer. Anything under docs/sprites/ is an exception to the
# blanket *.png ignore above.
!docs/sprites/**
!docs/sprites/**/*.png
tmp/
